{"sourceUrl":"https://gggl.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0812/c11904a861678/page.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:08.463541+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://gggl.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0812/c11904a861678/page.htm","html":"<div><p><span> 为进一步深化我院博士研究生招生制度改革，探索和完善高层次</span><span>拔尖创新人才的选拔机制，根据教育部及学</span><span>校相关文件要求，并结合</span><span>我院学科发展与人才培养的实际需要，现决</span><span>定开展从具备推荐免试资</span><span>格的优秀应届本科毕业生中选拔直接攻读博</span><span>士学位研究生（以下简称</span><span>“直博生</span><span></span><span>”）</span><span></span><span>的工作。</span></p><p><span><strong>一</strong></span><span></span><span><strong>、招生计划</strong></span></p><p><span><span>公共管理学</span></span><span>一级学科博士点专业可招收直博生。拟接收直博生</span><span>招生人数如下表。</span></p><center><table><tbody><tr><td><p><span><span><span>招生专业代码</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>招生专业</span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span>招生计划数</span></span></span></p></td></tr><tr><td><p><span><span><span><span><span>120400</span></span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p><span><span><span><span>公共管理学</span></span></span></span></p></td><td><p>≤<span><span><span><span><span>2</span></span></span></span></span></p></td></tr></tbody></table></center><p><br/></p><p><span><strong>二</strong></span><span></span><span><strong>、</strong></span><span></span><span><strong>申请条件</strong></span></p><p><span>     （一）拥护中国共产党的领导，遵纪守法，品行端正，无任何考试作弊、学术不端及其他违法违纪行为；</span></p><p><span>     （二）在目前就读学校取得教育部推荐免试研究生资格的优秀应届本科毕业生；</span></p><p><span>     （三）研究兴趣浓厚，有较强创新意识和创新能力及牢固的专业基本知识。具有被推荐高校认定的特殊学术专长的，可优先考虑；</span></p><p><span>     （四）诚实守信、学风端正、不存在任何违反学术道德和专业伦理的行为，以及在本科学习期间未受过任何行政处罚或处分；</span></p><p><span>     （五）身体健康状况符合教育部等部门制定的《普通高等学校招</span><span>生体检工作指导意见》，</span><span></span><span>并满足我校</span><span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span>年博士研究生招生简章中</span><span>规定的其他报考条件。</span></p><p><span><strong>三</strong></span><span></span><span><strong>、报名和复试安排</strong></span></p><p><span> （一）</span><span></span><span>报名程序</span></p><p><span> 凡符合上述申请条件且有意愿报考的全国优秀应</span><span>届本科毕业生，</span><span>请注册登录我校推免生预报名系统</span><span>（</span><span><a href=\"https://yjsxt.jnu.edu.cn/gsapp/sys/yjszsrzfwapp/tmybm/user/lo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>https</span></span><span><span>://</span></span><span><span>yjsxt</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>jnu</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>edu</span></span><span><span>.</span></span><span><span>cn</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>gsapp</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>sys</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>yjszsrzfwapp</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>tmybm</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>user</span></span><span><span>/</span></span><span><span>lo</span></span></a><a href=\"https://gggl.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0812/c11904a861678/gin.do\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>gin.do</span></span></a></span><span>），</span><span></span><span>如实填写各项信息并提交材料。</span></p><p><span> 同时，请于</span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span><span>9</span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span>14 </span></span></span><span>日前，将以下材料汇总形成一个</span><span><span><span>PDF</span></span></span><span>文件发送至邮箱</span><span><span><span><span>2825918346@qq.com</span></span></span></span><span>，</span><span></span><span>文件命名为“</span><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span></span><span>直博</span><span>生</span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span>推免生系统报名号</span><span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span></span></span></span><span>申请直博专业</span><span><span><span>+</span></span></span><span>姓名</span><span></span><span>”。具体</span><span>材料要求如下：</span></p><p><span>       1. 《暨南大学2027年接收优秀推荐免试攻读硕士研究生申请表》，预报名系统填报信息后生成该申请表，须申请人签名；</span></p><p><span>       2. 政审</span><span>表、</span><span>2</span><span>位正高职称专家推荐</span><span>信、</span><span>拟攻读博士研究计划等应交材料</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>       3. 本科阶段综合成绩排名证明（含申请人所在专业同年级人数、</span><span>本科三年的综合成绩总评名次、排名比例等内容，并加盖学校教务部门公章</span><span>）；</span></p><p><span>       4. 外语水平证明，</span><span>如</span><span>CET-6</span><span>成绩</span><span>、雅思</span><span>、托福</span><span>、专业英语等；</span></p><p><span>       5. 有关学术科研成果和获奖证书，</span><span>如发表论文</span><span>、</span><span>出版物或其他</span><span>原创性工作。</span></p><p><span> （二）</span><span></span><span>复试</span></p><p><span> 学院将根据申请情况择时进行筛选，择优确定复试名单并发出复</span><span>试通知（具体安排以学院通知为准）</span><span></span><span>。</span></p><p><a href=\"https://gggl.jnu.edu.cn/2026/0812/c11904a861678/page.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span> 直博生选拔工作遵循“德、智、体全面衡量，择优录取，保证质</span><span>量，</span><span><span>宁缺毋滥</span></span><span>”的原则，</span><span></span><span>由学科点统一组织进行。复试着重考查申请</span><span>者外语应用能力、综合运用所学知识的能力</span><span>、科研创新潜质、对本学</span><span>科前沿领域及最新研究动态的掌握情况等方面。</span></p><p><span> 学科点成立考核小组，由不少于</span><span><span><span>7</span></span></span><span>名研究生导师组成。直博生每人面试时间不少于</span><span><span><span>30</span></span></span><span>分钟，</span><span></span><span>采用</span><span><span><span>PPT</span></span></span><span>汇报和口头问答的方式进行。</span><span>其中，</span><span></span><span><span><span>PPT</span></span></span><span>汇报时间不超过</span><span><span><span>15</span></span></span><span>分钟，</span><span></span><span>内容包括：</span><span></span><span>个人报考信息</span><span></span><span>、学</span><span>习经历、社会兼职、个人综合素质能力、个人本科期间学习情况及获奖情况等，本科阶段参与课题情况、取得的成果、科研兴趣、研究生阶段的研究设想等。专家围绕英语应用能力、专业基础、科研综合能</span><span>力等方面进行提问。</span></p><p><span> 通过直博生选拔考核、成绩合格的推荐免试生，</span><span>即可获得当年度直博生拟录取资格。</span></p><p><span> （三）</span><span></span><span>正式报名</span></p><p><span> 通过预报名且复试合格、同时获得本科就读学校推荐免试资格者，</span><span>应在我校规定时间内按要求</span><span><span>在中国研招网上进行</span></span><span>博士生网上报名、复试确认、拟录取确认等相关手续。参加直博生复试的申请者，可同时参加同一专业的推免硕士生复试；未通过直博生选拔考核，但通过推免硕士生复试的</span><span>考生，</span><span></span><span>可获得复试专业的推免硕士生拟录取资格。</span></p><p><span><strong>四</strong></span><span></span><span><strong>、其他说明</strong></span></p><p><span> （一）</span><span></span><span>直博生学制为</span><span><span><span>5</span></span></span><span>年，入学后遵守博士研究生的管理</span><span>规章制</span><span>度，履行博士研究生的相关义务。直博生的培养方案、毕业要求及相</span><span>关管理办法将另行发布。</span></p><p><span> （二）</span><span></span><span>未能取得学士学位证书和本科毕业证书的考生，以及被取</span><span>消推荐免试资格者不予录取。欢迎全国各高校优秀应届本科推免生来</span><span>我校攻读直博生！</span></p><p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p><span><span>公共管理学院</span></span><span><span><span><span>/</span></span></span></span><span><span>应急管理</span></span><span>学院</span></p><p><span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span><span>6</span></span></span></span><span>年</span><span><span><span><span>8</span></span></span><span><span></span></span></span><span>月</span><span><span><span><span>12</span></span></span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>","textSha256":"9ee4a3fbbb167087c3a771bcb996b0c5500f4086c2736daf1e3875b90c99064a","textLength":1628,"sourceSha256":"b5f7677e96602b363a394c039da6a1ceed6415e2684b094bdaa1c9c0ea2850e2","selector":".wp_articlecontent","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-6dd4a56fe36261715396","title":"2026年暨南大学公共管理学院/应急管理学院2027年招收推荐免试攻读博士学位研究生（直博生）的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:08.463541+00:00"}
